<para><verbatim>embed:rst 
The sections identified by a hash alone, as ``(hash type in HashData, mod object name)``
:raw-html:`&lt;br /&gt;` :raw-html:`&lt;br /&gt;`
**Default**: the bone-data override (``cb4`` -&gt; ``boneData``) and the two shape-key
